    "name": "D.C. Re:tune",
    "steam_appid": 3287600,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pinnacle of school romance adventures, &quot;D.C.~Da Capo~&quot; returns with a complete remake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Highlights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbNew storylines unfold with the addition of new heroines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFilled with vivid portrayals of the psychological distance between the heroines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA grandeur performance inspired by gorgeous illustrations from a team of highly acclaimed creators including Natsuki Tanihara and Yuki Takano</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAvailable with full voice acting (except the main character)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEnjoy stunning computer graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 STAFF</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Design: Natsuki Tanihara, Yuki Takano</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Art: Natsuki Tanihara, Yuki Takano, Haru Azuma, Shayuri</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario Director: Aibane</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planning &amp; Production: CIRCUS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publisher: Bushiroad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 CAST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asakura Nemu: Kaede Hondo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yoshino Sakura: Chiharu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shirakawa Kotori: Kana Ichinose</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amakase Miharu: Miku Ito</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mizukoshi Moe: Sayumi Suzushiro</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mizukoshi Mako: Yurie Ikoma</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sagisawa Yoriko: Kaori Ishihara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuuki: Hikaru Tono</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0The Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatsunejima, an island where the &quot;undying cherry blossoms&quot; bloom year-round, regardless of the season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Kazami Gakuen located on this Hatsunejima,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there's a boy who can magically create Japanese Sweets out of thin air,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and has the somewhat whimsical ability to show others their dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His catchphrase is &quot;what a drag&quot; - this boy, Asakura Junichi, is a student there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His nagging yet clingy step-sister, Asakura Nemu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The talented singer and school idol, Shirakawa Kotori, and others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Junichi has been living his school life, with graduation just around the corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then one day...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yoshino Sakura, his childhood friend who went abroad six years ago, returns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And surprisingly, she looks exactly the same as she did six years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a spring day with cherry blossoms quietly dancing in the air, an endearing love story begins\u2014</p>",
