p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there's a boy who can magically create Japanese Sweets out of thin air,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and has the somewhat whimsical ability to show others their dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His catchphrase is &quot;what a drag&quot; - this boy, Asakura Junichi, is a student there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His nagging yet clingy step-sister, Asakura Nemu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The talented singer and school idol, Shirakawa Kotori, and others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Junichi has been living his school life, with graduation just around the corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then one day...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yoshino Sakura, his childhood friend who went abroad six years ago, returns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And surprisingly, she looks exactly the same as she did six years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a spring day with cherry blossoms quietly dancing in the air, an endearing love story begins\u2014</p>",
